### Integrations

| Integration | Type | Environment variable |
|------------|------|---------------------|
{{- range .Integrations}}
{{- if eq . "anthropic"}}
| Anthropic | Model API | `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` |
{{- else if eq . "openai"}}
