{{- if gt (len .Knowledge) 0}}

### Knowledge stores

{{- range .Knowledge}}
{{- if eq . "qdrant"}}
- **Qdrant** — vector store for semantic search and embeddings
{{- else if eq . "redis"}}
- **Redis** — key-value store for caching and fast lookups
{{- else if eq . "neo4j"}}
- **Neo4j** — graph database for relationship data
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- if gt (len .Interfaces) 0}}

### Interfaces

{{- range .Interfaces}}
{{- if eq . "web"}}
- **Web** — HTTP/SSE endpoint (playground available at `localhost:3000` during dev)
{{- else if eq . "slack"}}
- **Slack** — bot integration via Socket Mode
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}
